{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-09-25T01:23:45.881Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.09.25.01.91.001","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CPU20260925001_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Papua","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 25 September 2026, 10:20 WIT di sebagian wilayah Papua, khususnya di ABEPURA, KAISENAR, MUARA TAMI, SENGGI, SKANTO, WAIBU.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 25 September 2026, 11:20 WIT.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1790298600000,"effective":1790299200000,"expires":1790302800000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CPU/2026/09/25/infografis.jpg","province":"Papua","districts":{"primary":["ABEPURA","KAISENAR","MUARA TAMI","SENGGI","SKANTO","WAIBU"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[-2.504,140.523],[-2.533,140.502],[-2.536,140.483],[-2.558,140.469],[-2.588,140.474],[-2.597,140.471],[-2.601,140.464],[-2.616,140.463],[-2.639,140.45],[-2.624,140.439],[-2.615,140.395],[-2.58,140.351],[-2.577,140.362],[-2.542,140.377],[-2.553,140.385],[-2.535,140.426],[-2.528,140.424],[-2.521,140.44],[-2.518,140.439],[-2.508,140.448],[-2.494,140.452],[-2.504,140.523]],[[-3.189,140.662],[-3.24,140.762],[-3.382,140.903],[-3.503,140.861],[-3.504,140.803],[-3.518,140.748],[-3.535,140.699],[-3.559,140.684],[-3.598,140.683],[-3.634,140.653],[-3.645,140.65],[-3.654,140.661],[-3.663,140.664],[-3.676,140.659],[-3.696,140.67],[-3.71,140.665],[-3.724,140.67],[-3.729,140.68],[-3.737